Known limitations:
Since strings can contain any type of white space, if there is an unclosed string
at line 7, but down on line 14 there exists another string that is propperly closed on
the same line, it will show there is an error on line 14 and it would treat what was supposed
to be the string as identifiers. This would make debugging difficult because the error could not
be easily found.

